Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:43:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Admin: one money story across Orders, Dashboard and the
 order page; row menu, due date, Browse fixes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- /admin/orders rows carry the resolved money block (invoice wins), and
  the Orders list reads Collected / Balance Due from it instead of the
  quote's deposit_amount, which said "$336 due" on paid-in-full orders.
- Dashboard "Unpaid balance" no longer adds a quote's balance on top of
  the invoice balance for the same order.
- Order page nets a quote-collected deposit out of invoice due when the
  invoices never booked it ("Paid $336 / Due $690").
- Row Actions menu opened on the second click: the click's own scroll
  of the overflow-x wrapper closed it. Scrolls in the first 350ms after
  opening are ignored.
- Invoice editor Due Date was blank: ISO timestamp → yyyy-MM-dd.
- Invoices header: filters scroll on their own so Quick bill / New stay
  on screen at phone width.
- Quote line Browse opens clean for a picked product (its full name
  searched to zero results); Browse is icon-only on phones so the
  product field keeps its width.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
